* The ladder disappears after save-quitting.
* [[Item Pool#Weight Decrementation|Weight decrementation]] in the generated shops is the same as in regular Angel Rooms, so if an item is seen in the special shop, it won't be encountered regularly again for the rest of the run.
* During the [[Ascent]], ladders will generate in the "starting rooms" (where light beams are located) on every floor.
** The same does not apply during {{chal|Backasswards}}, in which the item simply has no effect.
* The ladder will appear in the [[Mirrored World]] in the starting room, and will lead to the same shop.
* Rerolled items in the room will be taken from the Angel Room pool.
* Since a beggar always spawns immediately to the right of the entrance way, caution should be taken to avoid accidental donation.
* If a run is started with The Stairway, i.e. playing as {{C|Eden}} or having collected {{I|Eden's Blessing}}, the ladder will not appear on the first floor.
* In [[Greed mode]], the ladder does not go away when pressing the button to start the waves. This means money can be gathered from the waves before entering the Stairway shop.

== Interactions ==
* {{T|Adoption Papers}}: Does not affect the Angel shop.
* {{i|Coupon}} / {{p|Credit Card}} / {{i|Mr. ME!}}: Can be used to obtain items for free.
* {{I|Death Certificate}}: An additional ladder will spawn in one room of the Death Certificate area. This ladder leads to the same Angel Shop as the one in the starting room of the floor. Purchasing an item will remove Isaac from the Death Certificate area as though he had collected an item normally. Sometimes, the ladder will spawn directly on top of an item pedestal, making the Angel Shop impossible to enter without collecting that item and subsequently being removed from the area.
* {{I|Keeper's Sack}}: Buying items grants stats, same as with other shops.
* {{I|A Pound of Flesh}}: Makes Angel Shops cost health just like regular {{r|Shop}}s.
* {{i|Restock}} / {{T|Store Credit}}: No effect in the Angel shop.
* {{i|Steam Sale}}: Reduces the prices of the items on offer.
* {{i|Glowing Hourglass}}: When used in the Angel shop, uses all three charges and removes the ladder.

