== Trivia ==
* This item was originally called [[anti:Jacob's Ladder|Jacob's Ladder]] in the ''Antibirth'' mod but was changed to avoid confusion between this item and the existing {{i|Jacob's Ladder}}. In ''Antibirth'', the ladder would take Isaac to a regular Angel Room instead of a unique Angel Shop, however using the ladder prevented an Angel or Devil Room from appearing after fighting the boss. The ladder would also not disappear when Isaac left the starting room.
** The name is a reference to The Book of Genesis from the Old Testament. In Genesis 28:10-19 Jacob rested on his journey and had a dream; in the dream, he saw a ladder that served as the connection between Heaven and Earth.
* This item's name and its flavor text are a reference to the Led Zeppelin song "Stairway to Heaven."

